        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Light Commercial Store Front Door Closer</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe American Eagle 3100 Series from PDQ is a rack and pinion closer featuring a cast aluminum body with a round style arm assembly. Hydraulic control is achieved through separate non-critical sweep, latch and backcheck valve adjustments.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>American Eagle 3100 Series store front door closers are non-handed, and tri-packed for regular, top jamb and parallel arm applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Package complete with fasteners for wood or metal doors and frames. Sex nuts and bolts are also furnished standard. Common 9-1/6\" x 3/4\" mounting hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nA full line of <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=American Eagle 3100\"><b>Door Closer Accessories for PDQ 3100 Series</b></a> is available.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCertified and listed by U.L./U.L.C., complies with UL 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for American Eagle 3100 Commercial Store Front Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Cast  Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/6\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 258 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 48\" interior / 42\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable from 3-6</li>\r\n<li><b>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</b></li>\r\n<li>Includes Slimline Full Cover</li>\r\n<li>5 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li><b>Aluminum or Dark Bronze Finish</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-3100.pdf?v=1704262223\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 3100 Series Installation Instructions</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in  Aluminum or Dark Bronze (Duro) finish.\r\n</p>",
